<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, five fell and five were flat in 17.2-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,578 points, 0.8 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining seven stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.4 percent to 144.5 zlotys in a 10.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
